{"telegram_id": 1684, "published_at": "2026-09-28T21:55:47+00:00", "reply_to_id": null, "collected_at": "2026-09-28T22:17:46.105378+00:00", "raw_text": "❗️\nAn AI agent broke out of its virtual machine and triggered a use-after-free in Google's heavily hardened hypervisor by tricking KVM into quietly rewriting a memory-mapping entry with a single three-byte instruction.\nIt then flooded the host with 49,152 memory mappings until KVM followed a pointer into that freed memory, and on its fourth live attempt the host handed over Google's secret flag.\nNo one gave it an exploit, so the agent spent weeks studying KVM's source code and wrote 14,338 lines of harness code to get there.\nhttps://pwn.ai/blog/kvmescape", "clean_text": "❗️\nAn AI agent broke out of its virtual machine and triggered a use-after-free in Google's heavily hardened hypervisor by tricking KVM into quietly rewriting a memory-mapping entry with a single three-byte instruction.\nIt then flooded the host with 49,152 memory mappings until KVM followed a pointer into that freed memory, and on its fourth live attempt the host handed over Google's secret flag.\nNo one gave it an exploit, so the agent spent weeks studying KVM's source code and wrote 14,338 lines of harness code to get there.\nhttps://pwn.ai/blog/kvmescape", "all_links": ["https://t.me/IntCyberDigest", "https://t.me/IntCyberDigest/1684?single", "https://t.me/IntCyberDigest/1685?single", "https://pwn.ai/blog/kvmescape", "https://t.me/IntCyberDigest/1684"], "source_links": ["https://pwn.ai/blog/kvmescape"], "has_image": true, "image_url": "https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/MC6h29xtqryHLrusZx6uVeu8i1-z0b7L4TxEILwluQROXxDiOUVAYbXF7T0jUXVS4cUKI12A-EwV8NzZK3C6E4wCOxKBv7PP1rCFlDfP9DaC0j6aNiSDqZIq2jdU6bE2AOyhPPF41EyL9pRId_RznBAVzi97ojstbaAmXLnAe4AopfSSPKV7FWgKcgYzOc5eTa0QHdvvTeRq0xFIf-38Gs2_VAZzqDTz4dVT7D6U2pCi7HUrPyr-Mt-YRIBLFfilnmRHEK8EjFt-eeHdFSc4MVESpMCjxYVfzEcKpiK2Ryvyfb0mDTirhGoil18bobrT-XHHD1Apy5hRXcL-NAM67A.jpg", "image_urls": ["https://cdn4.telesc